<title>AUSTRALIA: Intellect wins David Jones EFTPOS deal.</title>
<headline>Intellect wins David Jones EFTPOS deal.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electronic commerce company Intellect Holdings Ltd said on Wednesday it had won a contract worth more than A$1 million to supply EFTPOS (Electronic Funds Transfer at Point of Sale) terminals to all David Jones Ltd department stores.</p>
<p>Intellect said it had teamed up with Australia and New Zealand Banking Group Ltd and NCR Corp to win the business.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
</text>
